# Day 2 - Variables and Operators

A beginner-friendly Python practice project focused on variables, assignment, and arithmetic operators.

## Topics Covered

- Creating and updating variables
- Assigning values to multiple variables
- Basic arithmetic operations
- Exponentiation (`**`)
- Modulus (`%`) and floor division (`//`)
- Storing calculation results in variables
- Calculating total prices and averages

## Technologies Used

- Python 3

## How to Run

```bash
python day2.py
```

## Learning Outcome

Practiced working with variables and operators to perform mathematical calculations and solve simple real-world problems.

---

Built while learning Python.
